Project modification notice: GE-Proton macOS Wine PoC
Modification date: 2026-11-24
Scope: Extend EmulateModeset/WINE_EMULATE_MODESET to accept an optional "WxH" value that pins the emulated current display mode, so games that fake fullscreen by maximizing to the desktop size without calling ChangeDisplaySettings get a matching virtual resolution and render through the existing centered emulated-fullscreen path.
Original authors and LGPL-2.1-or-later licenses remain applicable; see UPSTREAMS.md and configs/source-license-inventory.json.

